<Slide notes={`这一节有六个知识块，都在回答同一个问题：一次调用凭什么算跑通了。

第一个先把说话的层次分清：API 是约定的接口，HTTP 和 JSON 负责传输与描述，SDK 把它们封装成程序库。分清之后，出错才有归属。

第二个立实验前提：日期、人数、时长、容量和已有预约都以材料为准，不能靠模型常识补齐。

接着是两条动手的线——用独立环境把校验器跑起来，再配上密钥和模型名发出第一次真实请求。最后两个知识块教按层排查，并把同一任务放进 WorkBuddy 取证。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>本节导读</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>一次调用凭什么算跑通了</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40 }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 340, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>先证明环境，再证明请求</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 3, background: '#26816B' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>六个知识块从"和谁说话"走到"产品路线怎么取证"：先分清层次，再固定材料，然后跑通本地校验器与第一次真实调用，最后学会按层排查、按证据验收。</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 11 }}>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 8, background: '#276FBF', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>01</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>先认识本章的学习环境</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>API、HTTP·JSON、SDK 三个层次，一次请求经过谁</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 8, background: '#276FBF', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>02</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>统一材料，才能比较结果</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>日期、人数、容量与已有预约以材料为准，不靠常识补齐</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 8, background: '#276FBF', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>03</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>安装独立的 Python 环境</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>建虚拟环境、装依赖、跑离线测试，再验参考排期</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 8, background: '#26816B', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>04</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>配置 API，再执行最小调用</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>密钥管认证，模型名管选型，两件事分开准备</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 8, background: '#26816B', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>05</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>出错时先分清发生在哪一层</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>先读错误类型，再决定重试、改配置还是改任务定义</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 8, background: '#CB6B28', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>06</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>在 WorkBuddy 中完成第一次任务</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>选工作空间、引用材料、打开实际文件对照</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.1 环境与第一次调用</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>02 / 24</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
